# lane/form-155-shared-provider-cache scope (issue #155, FORM-02 shared-provider-table cache):
# resolveFormProviders caches table scans by table before issuing another
# read (failures cached as null), so every source field on a shared table
# consumes one identical snapshot for options and auto-fill. Plus two
# deterministic resolver regressions (single-scan proof, fail-on-second-call
# sentinel). No new primitive, migration, route, auth, or budget change;
# docs/upstream-parity.md already states the same-scan invariant, so its
# text stands unchanged.
